{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11207460","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11207460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120746001:0":{"text":"자, 이걸 마시면 몸이 좀 나아질 거예요.","source_cn":"给你，把这瓶药喝下去，应该能改善一些身体的状况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA82CC8255F660DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120746002:0":{"text":"...미안해요.","source_cn":"……对不起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97EBC1A01925ACCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120746003:0":{"text":"금방 나을 거예요!","source_cn":"你们会很快好起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E345E652D861ECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120746004:0":{"text":"음… 팔이 들려지네!","source_cn":"唔……好像，胳膊能抬起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54B6D7D6E349C120","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120746005:0":{"text":"나도… 흐릿하던 눈이 보이기 시작했어.","source_cn":"我也是……渐渐能看清东西了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CE40C26B9FFB670","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120746006:0":{"text":"너… 너희는 사막의 발톱?! 어떻게 부족에 들어온 거지?!","source_cn":"你——你们是流沙之爪？！怎么会进到部落来？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8447971B0F99BEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120746007:0":{"text":"엔파, 뛰… 뛰어! 다시 잡히면 안 돼!","source_cn":"恩法，跑……跑！不能再被他们抓走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4F6D39E6D439DEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1120746007":{"text":"엔파, 뛰… 뛰어! 다시 잡히면 안 돼!","source_cn":"恩法，跑……跑！不能再被他们抓走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4F6D39E6D439DEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120746009:0":{"text":"병 주고 약 준다고... 사막의 발톱이 우리에게 남긴 상처가 사라질까?","source_cn":"道歉、治疗……流沙之爪留在大家身上的伤痕，难道靠道歉就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17A127FBF4290B85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120746010:0":{"text":"알아요. 그냥 미안하다고 사과하고 싶었어요.","source_cn":"我知道，所以只是来说声对不起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDA10C74387A87F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120746011:0":{"text":"미, 미안…해요. 루마랑 치크도 잘못한 거 알아요. 나쁜 사람들이랑 어울려서 미안해요.","source_cn":"对、对不起……卢玛和奇克，知道错了。我们不该和坏人一起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA13EB9160DF440E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120746012:0":{"text":"아무것도 못 해서 미안해요.","source_cn":"也不该什么都不做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF586B22490FEF7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120746013:0":{"text":"…됐어. 어쨌든 우릴 치료해줬잖아. 아틸라, 그만해.","source_cn":"……不管怎么说，他们的药确实很有用。阿蒂拉，别和自己的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x624F09D158C7E5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120746014:0":{"text":"쳇…","source_cn":"哼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E432E9A1B981E50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1120746015:0":{"text":"정말 좋은 사람이 되고 싶다면 다시는 사막의 발톱과 얽히지 마.","source_cn":"你们如果真的想做好人，记住，不要再和流沙之爪扯上任何关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EF5C25666CA343A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1120746016:0":{"text":"이제 그만 가. 애들한테 화풀이하고 싶지 않으니까.","source_cn":"走吧，我不想把仇恨指向孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF605C16ABF6D18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120746017:0":{"text":"호, 혹시 도움이 필요한 사람들을 알고 있어요?","source_cn":"那、那你们知道还有谁需要帮助吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A0B40E2A5A8D7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1120746018:0":{"text":"우린 도와주러 왔어요! 장난이 아니에요!","source_cn":"我们，想帮忙！不是捣乱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1AE124372D3259A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1120746019:0":{"text":"…지금 부족 마을을 재건 중이긴 하지만, 너희같이 어린애들한테는 어려워.","source_cn":"……部族正在重建，像你们这么瘦弱的小孩，做不来苦力活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4F4AED1A213FFEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1120746020:0":{"text":"정말 돕고 싶다면 <style=\"highlight\">부족 동쪽 평원</style>으로 가봐. 요타스가 초코보를 길들이고 있을 텐데, 반나절이 지나도 돌아오지 않고 있어.","source_cn":"你们要是真想帮忙，就去<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC6A7197E350A95C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1120746021:0":{"text":"그의 인정을 받는 건 너희에게 달렸어.","source_cn":"至于他让不让你们帮，就看你们自己了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ACC3A6D5E049CF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1120746022:0":{"text":"동쪽, 초코보… 알겠어요. 감사합니다!","source_cn":"东边，陆行鸟……我知道了，谢谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B6E186F4B1A8E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"치크와 루마는 사과하러 온 거야","source_cn":"奇克和卢玛是来道歉的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3590C113A0BF6A47","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"치크와 루마는 사과하러 온 거야","female":"치크와 루마는 사과하러 온 거야","variant_male_record_index":"64074","variant_female_record_index":"64075","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"너희를 치료한 약도 얘네가 만들었어","source_cn":"治疗你们的药，是他们做的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7E4042C82CBE1FAC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너희를 치료한 약도 얘네가 만들었어","female":"너희를 치료한 약도 얘네가 만들었어","variant_male_record_index":"64076","variant_female_record_index":"64077","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1120746008:0":{"text":"겨우 나쁜 짓을 안 했다는 한마디로 발뺌하려고? 그게 가능할 것 같아!?","source_cn":"一句没有作恶，就想撇清关系？怎么可能！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x275C1E7FE895E6AE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"겨우 나쁜 짓을 안 했다는 한마디로 발뺌하려고? 그게 가능할 것 같아!?","female":"겨우 나쁜 짓을 안 했다는 한마디로 발뺌하려고? 그게 가능할 것 같아!?","variant_male_record_index":"124774","variant_female_record_index":"124775","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:2:3":{"text":"사막의 발톱은 맞지만, 나쁜 짓은 안 했어","source_cn":"他们是流沙之爪，但没有行恶","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B0ADC77A18FB1B7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_k